Our platform allows users to upload documents or paste code directly to check for
plagiarism. After analysis, the system provides a plagiarism score and simultaneously generates an
AI-rewritten version of the same content to help improve originality. The goal is to ensure academic
integrity, originality, and legal safety for users across different fields.

How the System Works?
1. User logs in to the website 
2. An input box is provided where the user
can upload a PDF file, Word/text file, or paste code directly 
3. After submission, the system
analyzes the content and displays the plagiarism percentage 
4. An AI-rewritten version of the same code/text is generated side-by-side 
5. All checked content is saved in the History section
6. Users can delete saved content for privacy


Key Features=>
-Multi-language plagiarism detection 
- Source highlighting 
- Detection of missing or incorrect citations 
- Role-based login 
- Detection of ChatGPT and AI-generated text 
- Secure history storage with delete option


Frontend Technologies:HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React / Next.js, Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap
Backend Technologies: Node.js, Python

